//RS /// c109 Phase 10: a fallible core call composed with `??` (Phase 8). `fs.read`
//RS /// returns `Result<String, IOError>`; the `??` value fallback unwraps it, so
//RS /// `read_or` is covered and the `jet_std_fs_read(&(…))` form composes with the
//RS /// `match { Ok(v) => v, Err(_) => fb }` fallback. The missing file takes the
//RS /// fallback branch — proving the composition runs.
